  "instructions": [
    "1. In a large bowl, combine the cabbage, carrots, red onion, tomatoes, and green chili peppers.",
    "2. Add the grated ginger and olive oil to the bowl, and mix well.",
    "3. Add the torn injera to the bowl and toss to combine.",
    "4. Season with salt to taste.",
    "5. Cover the bowl with plastic wrap and refrigerate for at least 30 minutes to allow the flavors to meld.",
    "6. Serve the Azifa chilled or at room temperature."
